WEBVTT

1
00:00:12,250 --> 00:00:13,450
Mom is usually very gentle

2
00:00:13,450 --> 00:00:15,290
I wish I could break a penny into two cents

3
00:00:15,290 --> 00:00:18,530
Why did you suddenly become so generous today? What are you looking at?

4
00:00:18,530 --> 00:00:20,450
I’ve never seen any donations, mother.

5
00:00:20,690 --> 00:00:21,690
are you sick

6
00:00:21,690 --> 00:00:22,690
Why are you so generous all of a sudden?

7
00:00:22,690 --> 00:00:28,050
I don’t have a fever anymore. Go go go. What are you talking about? You are the one who is sick. Are you sick?

8
00:00:28,050 --> 00:00:29,130
Why did you donate so much?

9
00:00:29,130 --> 00:00:30,570
I thought according to your temper

10
00:00:30,570 --> 00:00:32,290
You can donate only fifty cents at most.

11
00:00:32,290 --> 00:00:33,210
what do you know

12
00:00:33,210 --> 00:00:34,370
I don’t donate a lot of money just for you

13
00:00:34,370 --> 00:00:36,570
You float around on the sea every day, and I give you so much love

14
00:00:36,570 --> 00:00:41,460
Only the Dragon King can keep you safe and sound.

15
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:43,900
You have been so lucky to be under the protection of the Dragon Prince these days.

16
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:44,900
If I don't express it

17
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:46,500
Lord Dragon thought that our family was ignorant

18
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:47,660
What should I do if I no longer protect you?

19
00:00:50,670 --> 00:00:51,750
The Dragon King is here

20
00:00:51,750 --> 00:00:52,950
Thank you Dragon King for blessing

21
00:01:00,820 --> 00:01:01,740
Half business

22
00:01:01,740 --> 00:01:02,980
Go find Song Yuan and the others to meet up

23
00:01:02,980 --> 00:01:11,600
Visit the temple fair together

24
00:01:11,600 --> 00:01:13,320
Who doesn't understand the rules so much?

25
00:01:13,320 --> 00:01:14,720
They actually had a quarrel in front of the Dragon King Temple

26
00:01:17,720 --> 00:01:18,720
No matter what he does

27
00:01:18,720 --> 00:01:22,700
Let's go our way

28
00:01:22,700 --> 00:01:23,660
This little beast

29
00:01:23,660 --> 00:01:24,820
Even my own brother is beaten

30
00:01:24,820 --> 00:01:26,560
Li Songyuan, you little bastard

31
00:01:26,560 --> 00:01:27,840
You and your shameless mother

32
00:01:27,840 --> 00:01:29,440
and your heartless uncle

33
00:01:29,440 --> 00:01:34,510
They should lead the army

34
00:01:34,510 --> 00:01:35,990
The one who broke the stick

35
00:01:35,990 --> 00:01:36,990
Isn’t it Li Song?
